<http://data.silknow.org/object/7002ad3c-ed59-3f00-b78b-855d3813436f>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of warp-faced silk brocaded with silk and metal thread impressed with lines; piced.\n\nExtensively pieced. The seams are easily seen from the back. There seems to be hardly any distortion to the pattern. In larger pieces impressed lines can be clearly seen: four lines form a lozenge around the motifs. The motif has a bird perched on a stem with 2 buds and one blossom. The birds face to the left on the bottom row and to the right on the top row. The silk appears to be floss [untwisted]. The leaves are green, the flowers are white and 2 shades of pink. The birds are also 2 shades of pink and white. There are traces of metal thread which is silver-gilt strip open S-wound on a pink silk core."@en , "Dress fabric of brocaded silk with silk and metal thread, Iran, 1800-1860"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/5fd65d11-d55f-36bb-beb6-336528793ec5> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of brocaded silk with silk and metal thread, Iran, 1800-1860"@en , "Dress fabric of warp-faced silk brocaded with silk and metal thread impressed with lines; piced.\n\nExtensively pieced. The seams are easily seen from the back. There seems to be hardly any distortion to the pattern. In larger pieces impressed lines can be clearly seen: four lines form a lozenge around the motifs. The motif has a bird perched on a stem with 2 buds and one blossom. The birds face to the left on the bottom row and to the right on the top row. The silk appears to be floss [untwisted]. The leaves are green, the flowers are white and 2 shades of pink. The birds are also 2 shades of pink and white. There are traces of metal thread which is silver-gilt strip open S-wound on a pink silk core."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/7002ad3c-ed59-3f00-b78b-855d3813436f/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7002ad3c-ed59-3f00-b78b-855d3813436f/dimension/2> ;
        dc:identifier                  "T.21:19-1955" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs>
                <https://collections.vam.ac.uk/item/O229621> .

